  introLines:
  - Welcome to my LAB-oratory! The 'oratory' is where I give speeches.
  - I taught every element to REFUSE to bond. No more water! No more salt! Only CHAOS!
  - Chemistry? I prefer CHAOS-try.
  finalDefeatLine: NO... YOU UNDERSTOOD THE SYSTEM!
  hintTaunts:
  - Count the valence electrons, genius. Oxygen wants TWO. Not one. TWO.
  - Sodium GIVES. Chlorine TAKES. It's practically a soap opera.
  teachingLines:
  - '*sigh* Fine. Lab safety lecture. Goggles ON.'
  - Atoms bond to fill their outer shell. Drag some together. Watch them... ugh...
    get along.
  - See how carbon grabs four hydrogens? Disgusting teamwork. Now try it yourself.
  rematchLine: SHOW ME WHAT YOU LEARNED.
